Name: meshioplusplus
Version: 20.1.0
Date: 2026-11-11
Author: Vicente Mataix Ferrandiz <tote1989@gmail.com>
Maintainer: Vicente Mataix Ferrandiz <tote1989@gmail.com>
Title: Read, write and operate on scientific computing and FEM mesh formats
Description: Bindings to the meshio++ C library for reading and writing the
 mesh file formats used in scientific computing and finite element analysis
 (Gmsh, VTK, VTU, Abaqus, Exodus, MED, XDMF and many others), together with
 its operations layer: surface extraction, mesh quality metrics, refinement,
 decimation, partitioning, smoothing, slicing and isosurfaces. The same
 sources also run in MATLAB (see mio_build). The meshio++ C library must be
 installed separately; see the package README.
Categories: Mesh, Input/Output, Geometry
Depends: octave (>= 8.0.0)
License: MIT
Url: https://github.com/loumalouomega/meshioplusplus
SystemRequirements: meshio++ C library (libmeshioplusplus)
